msgid ""
"Certificates store and historise your company's attestations (ISO, HDS, ...)"
" - track issuing body, validity dates, attach the PDF, and follow renewals."
msgstr ""
"Les certificats conservent et historisent les attestations de votre "
"entreprise (ISO, HDS, ...) - suivez l'organisme émetteur et les dates de "
