msgid ""
"The finding is created in the nonconformity register from run %(ref)s : its "
"observations become the description, and the control's requirements its "
"related requirements."
msgstr ""
"Le constat est créé dans le registre des non-conformités à partir de "
"l'exécution %(ref)s : ses observations deviennent la description, et les "
"exigences de la mesure ses exigences associées."

